{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:47 2026-09-24 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:47 2026-09-24 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:47 2026-09-24 HKT</p><p>紅磡差館里地下一間標榜售賣老火湯的自家湯店舖，於今晨（24日）7時許發生火警。有街坊發現店舖內傳出陣陣燶味，於是報警。現場是差館里19A，消防員進入店舖發現是煲燶湯，隨即將爐頭火救熄。</p><p>現場消息稱，涉事自家湯店於今日凌晨3時煲老火湯，預備今日稍後開門營業時售賣，未料失火。警方調查後相信火警起因無可疑，事件中沒有人受傷。</p><img alt=\"自家湯店舖發生火警。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/3bde4de3e266e8471e7c152cbdfcc381/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_08_27_54.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"店內煲燶湯失火。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ceeae6534bcf30cb6151c82d209affee/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_08_27_53.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/40586e3453700e50a95dec3f7889a1d3/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_08_27_52.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/192e5b51e50868631bf1398829d05feb/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_08_27_53_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/30b959c090a5b5424af4d8c89d6a569d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_08_27_53_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ed07ba03518e21ba120376b032219ef9/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_08_27_56.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/1f52f18191cdcb90e860a49e92547382/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_08_27_55.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T00:59:01.900512+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}